#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:45
#: 22c1b325792746fb9a3a929efa9f64d2
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:46
#: 93cad9ccd4ea48548b75c1ee700aa3d9
msgid ""
"The default RC input is configured on UART2, and all ArduPilot compatible "
"protocols, except PPM and SBUS, are supported. SBUS support is provided via "
"the HD VTX connector on SERIAL1 and but requires the protocol be set to "
":ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = \"23\" and to change "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` to something other than '23'."
msgstr ""
"默认RC输入配置在UART2，支持除PPM和SBUS以外的所有ArduPilot兼容协议。SBUS支持通过HD图传接口上的SERIAL1提供，但需将协议设置为"
" :ref:`SERIAL1_PROTOCOL<SERIAL1_PROTOCOL>` = 「23」，并将 "
":ref:`SERIAL2_PROTOCOL<SERIAL2_PROTOCOL>` 改为非 「23」 的值。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:48
#: 7ec338cf15fa40ba957edcbce37db6c3
msgid "PPM is not supported"
msgstr "不支持PPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:49
#: a4d37c56e1be4088a696aeb70c5d3a00
msgid ""
"FPort requires an external bi-directional inverter (see :ref:`common-fport-"
"receivers`)"
msgstr "FPort需要外部双向反相器（参见 :ref:`common-fport-receivers`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:50
#: e6888ec7db69412183ab9ea5af8fca8a
msgid "CRSF requires connection to TX2 and automatically supports telemetry"
msgstr "CRSF需连接TX2，并自动支持数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:51
#: f45a947d4ffd419fbe41135d4d3f452a
msgid ""
"DSM/SRXL connects to the RX2 pin, but SBUS would still be connected to SBUS."
msgstr "DSM/SRXL连接至RX2引脚，但SBUS仍连接至SBUS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:52
#: e830acaaf2b44f4d82bea83b3131829e
msgid ""
"SRXL2 requires a connection to TX2 and automatically provides telemetry. Set"
" :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` to “4”."
msgstr ""
"SRXL2需连接TX2，并自动提供数传。将 :ref:`SERIAL2_OPTIONS<SERIAL2_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:55
#: 530333892a8c4ef6a87410ae4defb94a
msgid "FrSky Telemetry"
msgstr "FrSky数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:56
#: 17eabcf133d24f2481216fdba9a69e96
msgid ""
"FrSky Telemetry can be supported using a spare UART's transmit pin. For "
"example, you could set the following parameters to enable support for FrSky "
"S.PORT on SERIAL4"
msgstr "FrSky数传可通过任意空闲UART的发送引脚实现。例如，可设置以下参数在SERIAL4上启用FrSky S.PORT支持："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:58
#: fc142b10e0f94333adcec071cccb847c
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 10"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_PROTOCOL<SERIAL4_PROTOCOL>` 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:59
#: 971376db1c9f4a1d907f200ff005e845
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 7"
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL4_OPTIONS<SERIAL4_OPTIONS>` 7"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:62
#: 0fc513448d244ce3a207f1b5bd1945b1
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:63
#: 877ec54dbd164b558496d5de1b9583f7
msgid ""
"The BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver). "
"Simultaneously, DisplayPort HD VTX connections can be made to UART3 "
"(included on the HD VTX connector)."
msgstr ""
"BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 支持使用OSD_TYPE "
"1（MAX7456驱动）的OSD。同时可通过UART3（包含在HD图传接口上）进行DisplayPort HD图传连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:66
#: e2d040589a6c4ec296da45e94b8859b0
msgid "VTX Support"
msgstr "图传支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:67
#: d75ecac89a2b47499d46ad4f63664f3a
msgid ""
"The SH1.0-6P connector supports a standard DJI HD VTX connection. Pin 1 of "
"the connector is 10v so be careful not to connect anything that could be "
"damaged by this voltage."
msgstr "SH1.0-6P接口支持标准DJI HD图传连接。接口第1针为10V，请勿连接不能承受该电压的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:71
#: b7fc8df8b5634aebbfc1383a85750611
msgid "PWM Outputs"
msgstr "PWM输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:72
#: 23ef8b65f9c84502aaed931dd7909940
msgid ""
"The BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 supports up to 9 PWM outputs. Outputs 1-4 are on the "
"ESC connector, while the others are available via solder pads."
msgstr "BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 最多支持9路PWM输出。输出1-4在ESC接口上，其余通过焊盘引出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:74
#: 75c4af4312d7477d9d6d2850065cdba3
msgid "Channels 1-8 support DShot. Channels 1-4 support bi-directional DShot."
msgstr "通道1-8支持DShot。通道1-4支持双向DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:77
#: 34e8b4d144ca4186aed4aeccfc34d6bb
msgid ""
"PWM outputs are grouped into 5 groups and every group must use the same "
"output protocol:"
msgstr "PWM输出分为5组，每组必须使用相同的输出协议："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:80
#: 1dd6b2e9c7cd4856a8ec9fd591683ac5
msgid "PWM 1-2  in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 在第1组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:81
#: 32696abc20ef415ebacc13f3dc37f1f7
msgid "PWM 3-4  in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-4 在第2组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:82
#: 21f99090fbaa4cd094e6cce6959ba1a4
msgid "PWM 5-6  in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 在第3组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:83
#: 46b0617dba5246f3857c7e2bb25600e7
msgid "PWM 7-8  in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7-8 在第4组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:84
#: dae850bb8bec46dfb4b173e30a094c8a
msgid "PWM 9    in group5 (LED pad)"
msgstr "PWM 9 在第5组（LED焊盘）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:87
#: c4f7133fe7ba4879b635cb3d462a13d5
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:88
#: 43f937970c6a40cd88883086f8ddf3bf
msgid ""
"The board has a internal voltage sensor and connections on the ESC connector"
" for an external current sensor input. The voltage sensor can handle up to "
"6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电压传感器，ESC 接头上有外部电流传感器输入接口。电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:90
#: 9d8333cccd3f49bc93ecd5d1f9631584
msgid "The default battery parameters are:"
msgstr "默认电池参数为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:93
#: 6e15bce7eb85483e83fc3f16c3213aaf
msgid ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_MONITOR<BATT_MONITOR>` = 4"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:94
#: ca75b78dba9d485c906780d0c70e8043
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 10"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:95
#: 1883b026e8c54fbba983d5d2ba18361c
msgid ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:96
#: eeb39b7a5a9f4a7ab7ff60910224cf09
msgid ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 11"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:97
#: 8ab7fb23dfd44d328a015eea202e5c4f
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = 25.9 (will "
"need to be adjusted for whichever current sensor is attached)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"25.9（需根据所接电流传感器进行调整）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:100
#: 1bd49a5a3bfd40d1ab9d12d9c06b692d
msgid "RSSI"
msgstr "RSSI"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:101
#: 70a88738543443b3ac3c802a2d78192c
msgid "ADC Pin 15 -> RSSI voltage monitoring"
msgstr "ADC引脚15 -> RSSI电压监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:104
#: a6e0ed59cf5e470591702b1627716ba2
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:105
#: d240d2c9b7074dae9fefc19bf089ba81
msgid ""
"The BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach "
"an external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL connector."
msgstr "BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 无内置罗盘，但可通过SDA和SCL接口使用I2C连接外部罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:108
#: 2df21772a95445c2b35816583213d98a
msgid "Firmware"
msgstr "固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:109
#: 144efb7483444d41ae2d3ba3c45c1996
msgid ""
"Firmware for the BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 can be found `here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in sub-folders labeled "
"“BROTHERHOBBYF405v3\"."
msgstr ""
"BROTHERHOBBYF405v3 的固件可在 `此处 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ 的 "
"「BROTHERHOBBYF405v3」 子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:112
#: fec8109b66494d039852c450f65599ff
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:113
#: a2b83d88ca0d42ea85b1f5966c0720eb
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the "
"bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" "
"firmware, using your favorite DFU loading tool."
msgstr "首次固件加载可在按住引导程序按钮插入 USB 时通过 DFU 完成。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU 烧写工具加载「with_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-brotherhobbyf405v3.rst:115
#: 47fb2b7704a64f66b51a6069a99d61da
msgid ""
"Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any "
"ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the "
"\"\\*.apj\" firmware files."
msgstr "初始固件加载完成后，可使用任何 ArduPilot 地面站软件更新固件。更新应使用「\\*.apj」固件文件。"
